{
  "feature": "Deck printings: the picker in deck scope (PR 4)",
  "note": "Run against a server started with DECK_PRINTINGS_ENABLED=true. DP_DECK is a deck the signed-in account owns that holds a card owned in two or more printings (DP_CARD) and one owned in exactly one (DP_SINGLE). On local-dev the probe account's `Card mark probe fixture` (d0000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000cafe) serves, with DP_CARD=Solemn Simulacrum and DP_SINGLE=Etchings of the Chosen; its commander is owned in one printing, so its row shows the plain Set field. The `picked` row WRITES a pick to that deck: run on local-dev or a scratch branch only, and delete the deck_printings row afterwards so the `open` row starts unpicked next time. Not reachable in a browser and held by unit tests instead: a refused save (`card-detail-deck-printings.test.tsx`), and overflow past 12 owned printings (no card in the probe account's decks has that many; `printing-region.test.tsx`).",
  "shares": {
    "module": "src/components/cards/printing-region.tsx",
    "binding": "PrintingRegion",
    "note": "The deck and /collection open the same modal, which renders the region; deck scope is a prop on it, never a second picker."
  },
  "rows": [
    {
      "id": "closed",
      "label": "/decks/[id]: a deck card's details, the Set field with N printings you own",
      "view": "src/components/cards/card-modal.tsx",
      "steps": [
        {
          "goto": "/decks/${DP_DECK}",
          "wait": "main, [role=main], h1",
          "settle": 5000
        },
        {
          "clickRole": "button",
          "name": "^View details for ${DP_CARD}$",
          "wait": "[role=dialog]",
          "settle": 2500
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "open",
      "label": "/decks/[id]: the picker open, nothing picked: the deck intro and Shown now on the fallback",
      "view": "src/components/cards/card-modal.tsx",
      "steps": [
        {
          "goto": "/decks/${DP_DECK}",
          "wait": "main, [role=main], h1",
          "settle": 5000
        },
        {
          "clickRole": "button",
          "name": "^View details for ${DP_CARD}$",
          "wait": "[role=dialog]",
          "settle": 2500
        },
        {
          "clickRole": "button",
          "name": "printings owned",
          "settle": 1200
        }
      ],
      "widths": [
        "desktop"
      ]
    },
    {
